@startmindmap substrate_map
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam dpi 150
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica

<style>
mindmapDiagram {
  node {
    BackgroundColor #EAF1FB
    LineColor #2E6DA4
    FontColor #15263F
    RoundCorner 10
  }
  .root {
    BackgroundColor #15263F
    FontColor #FFFFFF
  }
  .branch {
    BackgroundColor #2E6DA4
    FontColor #FFFFFF
  }
  .rq4 {
    BackgroundColor #FDEBD0
    FontColor #15263F
  }
}
</style>

* Localization\nsignals <<root>>
** Token-attribution\n(importance over content tokens) <<branch>>
*** Accumulated attention
*** Wu attention
*** QRHead attention
*** Transcoder attr\n(conditional, gate 11.2c)
** Component\n(score over 32 query heads/layer) <<branch>>
*** Wu heads
*** QRHead heads
*** ITI heads
*** Transcoder loadings
** Answer-position\n(RQ4 — reported separately) <<rq4>>
*** ITI direction <<rq4>>
*** Orgad answer tokens <<rq4>>

header
Substrates are NEVER merged (§6)
endheader

legend bottom
Agreement is defined **only within** a substrate. Wu and QRHead appear in two substrates
(attention summed onto tokens vs. their native head sets); Wu-vs-QRHead head-set Jaccard is a headline number.
endlegend
@endmindmap
